              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nina zinceku, thobelani amakhosi enu ngokwesaba konke; kungeyisikho kwabalungileyo labamnene kuphela, kodwa lakwabakhohlakeleyo.",
          "type": "text",
